2:3-2:15 "state Lonely" warning STATE_NOT_DRAWN: `state Lonely` on its own declares nothing, so `Lonely` is not drawn: mention it in a transition or give it a description, e.g. `Lonely : text`.
3:3-3:23 "note \"floating\" as N" warning FLOATING_NOTE: A note with `as` is not attached to a state and is not drawn: write `note left of <state>` or `note right of <state>`.
6:5-6:7 "--" warning EMPTY_REGION: A `--` separator needs states after it: a composite state whose last region is empty is drawn without regions.
